    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of city life, you\u2019ve finally quit your job to chase your true passion \u2014 farming. Now, it\u2019s time to turn your dream into reality as you set out to build and work on your own farm! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plant and harvest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a beginner farmer, you\u2019ll start small \u2014 planting and harvesting your first vegetables and fruits. Be patient and attentive, as each plant needs special care.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock a wider variety of vegetables and fruits to cultivate, expanding your farm\u2019s potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/2509dc7603293a186a29754b815bcb2d.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Livestock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No farm is complete without livestock, and Harvest Hills is no exception. Care for your animals to produce goods like eggs, milk, honey, and wool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/97d1a610d65b1035b8ed7e68b7bf7a4e.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Homemade products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your farm grows, you'll soon have the opportunity to purchase your first homemade products machine. Gather the necessary ingredients and use the machines on your ranch to create a variety of homemade goods, such as tomato sauce, juice, cheese, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/e8f97080065e1fa41658e18ce13379b0.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your harvested crops and homemade products at the local market to earn money. Use your earnings to upgrade and expand your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside your daily farm duties, complete simple tasks to unlock new farm objects and expand list of products you can cultivate and produce.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest dozens of vegetables and fruits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce animal products like honey, milk, eggs, and wool. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce a variety of homemade goods, including cheese, juice, tomato sauce, using your farm's products. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and organize your farm just the way you love it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell vegetables, fruits, and other products at the farmers' market to earn money and expand your farm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new farm objects as you progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a stunning low-poly world that captivates you for hours of endless play. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/217e7be138fb75c02b5ea843c4b4214a.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/659e6b16b240dfe3baa3093426398d23.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/99193df85ce80bad75b7d86cb86fe5df.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of city life, you\u2019ve finally quit your job to chase your true passion \u2014 farming. Now, it\u2019s time to turn your dream into reality as you set out to build and work on your own farm! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plant and harvest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a beginner farmer, you\u2019ll start small \u2014 planting and harvesting your first vegetables and fruits. Be patient and attentive, as each plant needs special care.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll unlock a wider variety of vegetables and fruits to cultivate, expanding your farm\u2019s potential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/2509dc7603293a186a29754b815bcb2d.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Livestock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No farm is complete without livestock, and Harvest Hills is no exception. Care for your animals to produce goods like eggs, milk, honey, and wool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/97d1a610d65b1035b8ed7e68b7bf7a4e.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Homemade products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your farm grows, you'll soon have the opportunity to purchase your first homemade products machine. Gather the necessary ingredients and use the machines on your ranch to create a variety of homemade goods, such as tomato sauce, juice, cheese, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/e8f97080065e1fa41658e18ce13379b0.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your harvested crops and homemade products at the local market to earn money. Use your earnings to upgrade and expand your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside your daily farm duties, complete simple tasks to unlock new farm objects and expand list of products you can cultivate and produce.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest dozens of vegetables and fruits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce animal products like honey, milk, eggs, and wool. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce a variety of homemade goods, including cheese, juice, tomato sauce, using your farm's products. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and organize your farm just the way you love it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell vegetables, fruits, and other products at the farmers' market to earn money and expand your farm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new farm objects as you progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a stunning low-poly world that captivates you for hours of endless play. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/217e7be138fb75c02b5ea843c4b4214a.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/659e6b16b240dfe3baa3093426398d23.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259620/extras/99193df85ce80bad75b7d86cb86fe5df.avif?t=1736976974\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Harvest Hills is a charming and relaxing farm simulator that allows you to run your own rancho. Cultivate various crops, take care of animals, and produce homemade products. Sell the goods in the local market to earn money and use it to upgrade or automate the farm.",
